abstract: "Strict within-benchmark U/M channel-to-parent matching and frozen-metric statistical reproduction. Not an independent dataset, OOD benchmark, or full HA-PaAno implementation. Enumerated original Python code/tests are MIT; original prose and author-licensable mapping, metadata and statistical compilations are CC BY 4.0, with third-party exceptions. Remote upload remains unapproved."
